{
    "title": "Frigidaire",
    "description": "No matter where your busy day takes you, you're always in control of your connected appliances with the Frigidaire app.\r\n\r\nFor all we share. Frigidaire.\r\n\r\nThe Frigidaire app currently works with selected connected air appliances and fridges.\r\n \r\n\u2022 Take care from anywhere \u2022\r\nTurn your appliances on or off, change settings, and monitor progress, at home or on-the-go.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Automate everyday tasks \u2022\r\nSchedule appliances around your busy day, so your home is always ready for playtime, dinnertime, or bedtime.\r\n \r\n\u2022 Helpful tips when you need them \u2022\r\nStay informed with timely expert tips and maintenance reminders. And, get weekly updates about all the work your appliance has done. \r\n \r\n\u2022 Voice control \u2022\r\nSometimes your hands are full. Control appliances with your voice by connecting Google Assistant or Amazon Alexa.",
